    "&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is an Japanese guide map produced in 2024.(1st Edition)&lt;br /&gt;\r\nYou can download them all at once as PDF files.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809719.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809655.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809723.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809724.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809658.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809659.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809660.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809661.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809662.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809663.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809664.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809665.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809666.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809667.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809668.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809669.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809670.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809671.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809672.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809673.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809674.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809675.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809676.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;img src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;amp;dateKey=202509&amp;amp;fileName=1752645809677.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&amp;nbsp;": 1,
    "&lt;div&gt;스마트 서울맵, 서울둘레길에 가장 최적화된 지도입니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n둘레길 걸으실때 활용하시면 많은 도움이 되실겁니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;1. 네이버나 다음, 구글에서 &amp;#39;스마트 서울맵&amp;rsquo;을 검색하세요. Play 스토어 앱 아닙니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;dateKey=202409&amp;amp;fileName=1726043697457.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;2. 화면 중단 왼쪽의 도시생활지도 클릭&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;dateKey=202409&amp;amp;fileName=1726043697458.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;3. 화면 왼쪽 위 네모 (9개 점이 있는 기호)를 클릭, 이 화면 뜨기까지 시간이 좀 걸림.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;dateKey=202409&amp;amp;fileName=1726043697459.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;4. 화면 중간의 서울둘레길 선택 후 지도 보기 클릭, 이 위치는 검색순위가 반영되기때문에 수시로 변함니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;dateKey=202409&amp;amp;fileName=1726043697460.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;5. 서울둘레길 전체 노선이 검색되며, 화면 오른쪽 세로줄 아래쪽에 있는 내 위치를 클릭하고, 화면을 서서히 확대하면 현재 내 위치 파악됨&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;dateKey=202409&amp;amp;fileName=1726043697461.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;6. 지도 확대하면 지하철 출구와 점선의 노선, 빨간 스탬프 통의 위치 등을 알 수 있어요.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 꼬물꼬물 움직이는 점선이 서울둘레길 노선입니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;/common/ckeditor/getImg.do?upKey=bbsctt&amp;dateKey=202409&amp;amp;fileName=1726043697463.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;안전하고 즐거운 서울둘레길 걷기가 되시길 바랍니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;": 1,
    "서울둘레길 2.0 코스별&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;span style=&quot;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:한컴돋움&quot;&gt;최신 자료는 스마트서울맵&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:한컴돋움&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;letter-spacing:0pt&quot;&gt;(https://map.seoul.go.kr/smgis2/themeGallery/detail?theme_id=1709800360723)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:한컴돋움&quot;&gt;에서&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;br /&gt;\r\n확인해 주시기 바랍니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:한컴돋움&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;letter-spacing:0pt&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;hwp_editor_board_content&quot; data-hjsonver=&quot;1.0&quot; data-jsonlen=&quot;6288&quot; id=&quot;hwpEditorBoardContent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n": 1
